teries and hazards  that is why people keep studying the sky  as diligently as thousands of years ago  in search of answers to their questions  and the gloomy boundless abyss of  interstellar space is as scary as it is  appealing  who knows  maybe at some point it will provide an  answer to a really major question  [Music]  you

